WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Read on hand, reserved and available
On hand is physically held stock. Reserved units are committed to
pending purchases. Available is what remains. Check the variant and
location on the same row.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Filter the right location
Use Location and Stock level filters. The search box searches location
names and codes, not variant SKUs. A missing search result does not
prove a product has no stock.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Identify where the units are held
Locations distinguish warehouses, stores and virtual buffers. Confirm
the code, type and active state before using a location in stock
operations.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Trace a stock change
Movements explain changes caused by orders, returns or adjustments. This
demo ledger is empty; existing balances alone do not prove a movement
was recorded.

